    <briefdescription>
<para>Ownership of the I2C infrastructure of the board. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Owns the interrupt controller handle, both I2C controller instances (PMBus and SysCfg) and the PI4MSD5V945X bus switch that segments the SysCfg bus. Addresses and channels are assigned here.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>This file is deliberately not called i2c.h - that name is already used by the BSP driver (mcu/software/standalone/driver/i2c.h) and every src directory is on the include path. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
